            "review_title": "Review at La Haye - Metropole",
            "review_text": "Lorenzo Satouri\nRome, Italy34 contributions\n0\nGreat place for business meetings\nNov 2024 • Business\nRecommended by a colleague at NAB who works at The Hallmark nearby. They offer a great set menu for lunch. The space in the restaurant is very elegant, suitable for business meetings. It is no surprise that the restaurant was almost full during our visit. In addition, this restaurant also offers my favorite, Bundaberg Sparkling.\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten November 28, 2024",
